ULIX is independent software built on India's Unified Logistics Interface
Platform (ULIP). It is not a government service, and it is not affiliated
with, endorsed by or sponsored by NICDC Logistics Data Services Ltd or the
Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade. The name sits close
to ULIP deliberately, which is exactly why that has to be said plainly here
as well as on the login and settings screens.

The endpoint catalogue in src/data/ulip/catalogue.ts is generated from the
ULIP integration documents published on goulip.in. Those documents and the
data they describe belong to their publishers; this licence covers only the
code in this repository. Production access to the ULIP gateway requires an
approved ULIP account and a signed NDA.

Consignment, fleet, document, customs and waterway data shown by this
software is simulated. See docs/DATA-PROVENANCE.md for exactly which parts
of the application are live and which are generated.

